5. Rule 3 of the C.C.S. (Pension) Rules, 1972 contains the definitions. Clause (o) in Sub-rule (1) of Rule 3 is as under:-
'pension' includes gratuity except when the term pension is used in contradistinction to gratuity;
From this definition of the word 'pension', it is clear that ordinarily the word 'pension' wherever used in these Rules includes gratuity except when the term 'pension' is used in contradistinction to gratuity.
